sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pharmacist as Pharmacist
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Pharmacist->>System: searchPendingPrescription(patientId)
    activate System
    System-->>Pharmacist: displayPrescriptionDetails(prescriptionId, drugList)
    deactivate System

    Pharmacist->>System: dispenseMedication(prescriptionId, itemsToDispense)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifyStockAvailability()
    System->>System: decrementInventory()
    System->>System: postPharmacyCharges()
    System-->>Pharmacist: dispensingSuccess(status="Dispensed", chargeItemId)
    deactivate System
